{"id":"vod_hh_53668","vodId":"53668","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"小蜜蜂寻亲记 昆虫物语","name_cn":"小蜜蜂寻亲记 昆虫物语","date":"1970-01-01","year":"1970","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第91集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/e51c1eef0ce4c35af9069dabda7086ac.jpg"},"summary":"小蜜蜂每天都和小昆虫们快快乐乐的玩耍着，和疼爱他的哈妮妈妈过着幸福的生活。因救了小蚂蚁，而认识的甲虫爷爷来到他家做客，小蜜蜂不经意间知道了自己的身世，原来他不并不是哈妮妈妈亲生骨肉。他刚出生时，蜜蜂王国因遭到大黄蜂的袭击，蜜蜂家族全军覆没。哈妮妈妈受女王的嘱托带着小蜜蜂逃了出来。现在知道他的亲生妈妈蜜蜂女王还活着，于是为了重新振兴蜜蜂王国小蜜蜂踏上了寻找妈妈的征程。小蜜蜂在寻找妈妈的路上还帮助了许多遇到困难的昆虫们。他虽然和同样在寻找自己的妈妈擦肩而过，但谁都没有发现彼此。小蜜蜂到底要经历多么艰辛的旅程，才能和妈妈重逢呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-03 01:00:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":91,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDZpAke/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penmnopd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOXVREb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAXj2je/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Qe1pxDqd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eV2g9oe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/xbonp0La/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9avxKrnd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2qzEAa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelkjN1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/meporqyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwyMAXa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGXyE5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXXm2Ve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdRK27we/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQKZR5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/wdL1MRve/index